(text "J2 pin3 receives screen TXD0_H; J2 pin4 drives screen RXD0_H. Direction is relative to THIS PCB." (at 15 251 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid a1c240dc-8ebf-5911-985c-e9f3a82b7d1d))
(text "Use the screen ADVANCE J10 5V input header. NEVER connect +5V to screen J2/HY2.0 3V3_OUT." (at 15 257 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid f48fbc37-4117-5dc9-9dbc-c6674f581d17))
(text "U4 DIR=HIGH: 3V3 A -> 5V B. U5 DIR=LOW: 5V B -> 3V3 A. Ioff/VCC isolation on translators." (at 15 263 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid 107c24e5-cde1-509e-8aca-b29049ce300c))
(text "UART TTL, NOT RS232/RS485. Long trunk-to-cabin cable at 921600 baud is NOT yet validated." (at 15 269 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid 42110b8a-fe77-5b6c-a3df-99b2885d6d54))
